## Scheduling Create [/scheduling/dispatchOption/{id}/account/{account}]

+ Parameters
    + id (String, Required) - Dispatch option indentifier
    + account (String, Required) - Token
    
### Create [POST]

<b>Create a new appointment based on one of the scheduling options were given. </b>

* callId (String, Required) - 
* companyName (String) - The name of the cusomer's company
* customerId (String, Required) - Customer identifier.
* firstName (String, Required) - First name
* lastName (String) - Last name (surename)
* mobile (String, Required) - Mobile/phones numbers separated by comma. First for text messages and other to display.
* addressDetails (String) - Address details
* customerTypeId (Int) - Customer type Id. Default is 0. (VIP, Buisness, Private etc.)
* customerJobDescription (String) - Customer description 
* dispatcherJobDescription(String) - Dispatcher description
* techJobDescription(String) - Technician description
* jobStatus(String) - Description of the job status
* openerName (String) - Name of representative who opened the call.
* serviceTypeId (Int) - Service type identifier (maintanance, installation, etc.) Default value is 0
* product (Object) - customer's product 
* id (String) - product identifier
* model (String) - product model
* productNumber (String) - product number
* serialNumber (String, Reqiured) - product serial number
* purchaseDate (String) - prduct purchase date yyyyMMdd
* warrantyExpiry (String) - product warranty expiration
* insuranceExpiry (String) - product insuarnce expiration
* installerName (String) - The person full name who install the product
* installerMobile (String) - The person mobile who install the product
* overrideCustomerData (bool) - Set to true in case customer data was changed. Default = false.
* driveUrl (String): Link to related files


+ Request (application/json) 

        {
           
            "callId": "123123",
            "companyName": "HP"
            "customerId":"67554735",
            "firstName": "Bill",
            "lastName": "Evans",
            "mobile": "+12025550142, +12025555179",
            "addressDetails": "floor 5 apartment 23",
            "customerTypeId" : 1,
            "customerJobDescription":"Can't turn it on",
            "dispatcherJobDescription": "Known issue on this product model",
            "techJobDescription": null,
            "jobStatus":"Second call",
            "openerName": "John Brown",
            "serviceTypeId": 1,
            "overrideCustomerData" : false,
            "driveUrl": "https://drive.example.com/file/abc",
            "product":
            {
                "id":"34567",
                "model":"abcde",
                "productNumber":"5865739003",
                "serialNumber":"A445bdfsf35",
                "purchaseDate":"20201223",
                "warrantyExpiry":"20210313",
                "insuranceExpiry":"20210710",
                "installerName":"John Smith",
                "installerMobile": "+12025553466"
            }
            
           
        }
        
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
