## Customer Create, List [/customer/account/{account}]

### Create [POST]
<b>Create a new customer with all contact details</b>

* id (Number, Required) - Customer identifier
* firstName (String, Required) - Customer first name 
* lastName (String, Required) - Customer last name
* address (String) - Customer address 
* city (String) - Customer city
* geolocation (String) - Customer location [latitude,longitude]
* addressDetails (String) - Customer address details. 
* mobile (String, Required) - Customer phone numbers separated by a comma. The first will be the primary phone
* typeId (Number) - Customer type Id  
* territoryId (String, Required) - Customer area id  
* directions (String) - Directions to customer address
* companyName (String) - Name of the customer's company


+ Request (application/json)

        {
           
            "id": "123123",
            "firstName": "John",
            "lastName": "Park",
            "address": "123 Test Street, New York",
            "city": "New York",
            "geoLocation": null,
            "addressDetails": "apartment 24",
            "mobile": "12025550142, 12025555179",
            "typeId": 0,
            "territoryId": 400,
            "directions": null,
            "companyName": "HP"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "code": 1000,
                "message": "OK",
                "description": null,
                "result": {
                   "id": "123123",
