## Customer History Upsert [/history/customers/{customerId}/account/{account}]

### Upsert [POST]

* customerId (String) - customer Id
* techId (Number) - technician identifier
* notes (String) - technician summery notes
* visitDate (String)- yyyyMMdd date format
* done (bool, nullable) - does the technician completed his tasks
* callId (String) - call idenitifier
* account (String) - account token


+ Request (application/json)

        [{
            "customerId": "426546457",
            "techId": "1239",
            "notes": "filter cleaning",
            "visitDate": "20220401",
            "done": true,
            "callId": "5543f-324fd-hfy5re45"
        }]

+ Response  200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "code": 1000,
                "message": "OK",
                "description": null,
                "result": null
            }
            
