## Technician Create, List [/technician/account/{account}]

### Create [POST]
<b>Create a new technician.</b>

* Id (String) - Technician identifier
* firstName (String) - Technician first name
* lastName (String) - Technician last name
* mobile (String) - Technician phone number
* typeId (String) - Technician type Id
* depotHour (String) - Default UTC start working hour in HHmm format
* depotAddress (String) - Default start address
* depotCity (String) - Default start city
* depotGeolocation - Default start geolocation
* lastAddress (String) - Last address
* lastCity (String) - Last city
* lastGeolocation - Default last geolocation
* skills (Array of Objects) - Array of skills (qualifications) the technician has. assembled from type and level
* territoryId (String) - List of prefered territories separated by comma (i.e 335,676,345)
* imgName (String) - Technician's image name (will be uploaded by FTP)
* teamId (String) - techncian's team Id


+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "Id": "123",
            "firstName": "John",
            "lastName": "Tech",
            "mobile": "026796636",
