## Shift Create, List [/shift/account/{account}?date={date}&id={id}]

### Create [POST]
<b> Create a shift for a technician. Define start and end date and time for the shift, depot (departure address) if different than the default (the home address).
This must be set before a scheduling request</b>

* startTime (String, Required) - Shift starting datetime in yyyyMMddHHmm format
* endTime (String, Required) - Shift ending datetime in yyyyMMddHHmm format
* territoryId (String, Required) - List of shift territory Ids separated by comma (default = null)
* timeZone (Number, Required) - Shift timezone in minutes
* techId (String, Required) - Techncian Id which will be associated to the shift 
* capacity (Number) - Vehicle capacity  (Default = null) 
* depotAddress (String) - Technciain depot 
* depotCity (String) - Technciain depot 
* depotGeolocation (String) - Technciain depot  (Required if depotAddress and depotCity are null)
* minWorkOrder (Number) - Minimum work orders for the shift  (default = 0)
* timeOff (Object) - define a time period during the shift which the technician will not be dispatched. You can specify an address which will be the route depot when timeOff will end 
* anchor (Object) - Automatically set an anchor to a shift in the most common geo location where most of the service calls are coming from, based on history and AI clustering. Used only on response object.
* enabled (Boolean) - Disabled shift to stop dispatch to the shift  
* canceled (Boolean) - Cancel the shift. If there are service calls, the cluster optimization will automatically rebalance all service calls without using the canceled shift.
+ Request (application/json)

        {
          
            "startTime": "201812130800",
            "endTime": "201812131800",
            "territoryId": "400, 401, 405",
            "timezone": "-240",
            "techId": "57778",
            "capacity": null,
            "depotAddress": "83 Gold St New York",
            "depotCity":"New York",
            "depotGeolocation":null,
            "minWorkOrder": 3,
            "timeOff": {"startHour":"201812131200", "endHour":"201812131600", "fullAddress": "18 Gold St New York", "city":"New York", "geocoding":null },
            "enabled":true,
            "canceled":false
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "code": 1000,
                "message": "OK",
                "description": null,
                "result": {
                    "Id":2998,
                    "startTime":"201812130800",
                    "endTime":"201812131800",
                    "territoryId":"400, 401, 405",
                    "timezone":"-240",
                    "techId":"57778",
