## Job Create, List [/job/account/{account}]

### Create [POST]
<b>Create a job (work order/call) for a technician <u>without</u> using the scheduling algorithms. It is recommanded adding jobs by using scheduling request and create methods  </b>

* jobId (String) - Job Id will be set once job created
* callId (String, Required) - Call identifier
* techId (String, Required) - Technician identifier
* preferred (Boolean, Required) - Is that the only technciain that should handle the job
* customerId (String, Required) - Customer identifier
* positionOnRoute (Number, Required) - job position number on the route (order # on the route)
* done (boolean) - Job has already done or not
* shiftId (String, Required) - Shift identifier.
* priority (Number) - Indicates job priority (1 (default) = normal / 10 / 100 / 1000 = highest priority)
* etaPrediction (String) - Job Estimated time of arrival to the customer [yyyyMMddHHmm]
* arrivalTime (String) - Actual arrival time to the customer [yyyyMMddHHmm] 
* departureTime (String) - Actual departure time from the customer [yyyyMMddHHmm]
* canceled (boolean) - Is the job active or canceled
* startTimeWindow (String) - start time window [yyyyMMddHHmm]
* endTimeWindow (String) - end time window [yyyyMMddHHmm],
* lockTimeWindow (Boolean) - Lock the time window or let the optimization to set the most efficient time window (default = true)
* taskIds (String, Required) - Tasks Id which assemble the job 
* serviceTime (Number) - job duration forecast
* serviceTypeId (Number) - Service type Id
* teamRequired (boolean) - Is a team reaquired to handle the job
* productId (String) - Product identifier which related to the job
* skills (Array Of Objects, Required) -  Skill type and skill level array that required to hanlde the job 
* openerName (String) - Job opener name
* descriptions (String) - Descriptions which describe the job 
* force (Boolean) - Is the job created by the scheduling algorithm or by force (default = false)
* urgency (String) - Describes the urgency of the job
* closed (Boolean) - Job is close for technicians report or open


+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "callId" : "5767484",
            "techId" : "1936",
            "preferred" : false,
            "customerId": "23445",
            "positionOnRoute": "5",
            "shiftId": "78241",
            "priority": 10,
            "startTimeWindow": "201902111000",
            "endTimeWindow": "201902111300",
            "lockTimeWindow": true,
            "taskIds": "23,45",
            "serviceTypeId": 2,
            "teamRequired": false,
            "productId": "45218",
            "skills": [{Id:1, level:1}, {Id:2, level:1}],
            "openerName": "Mary Ann",
            "descriptions": null,
            "urgency": null,
            "closed" : false
           
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {
                "code": 1000,
                "message": "OK",
                "description": null,
                "result": {
                    "jobId": "522981",
