## Route Optimization [/route/opt]

### POST [POST]

+ payload header

        Authorization: Bearer <token>



+ body

   + requestId (string, required) - request identifier
   + depotAddress (string, required) - departue address
   + depotLatitude (double, required) - departure latitude
   + depotLongitude (double, required) - departure longitude
   + depotDatetime (string, required) - departue date and time in yyyyMMddHHmm format
   + timezone (number, required) - timezone area
   + endPoints (array, required) - an array of end points 
   + geoId (string, required) - coordinates identifier
   + latitude(double, required) - latitude point
   + longitude (double, required) - longitude point
   + address (string, required) - end point address
   + startTimeWindow (string) - start time window if time window exists. in HHmm format
   + endTimeWindow (string) - end time window if time window exists. in HHmm format
   + eta (int, nullable) - will be sent as null
        
+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "requestId": "156387",
            "depotAddress": "Ben Yehuda 10 Tel Aviv",
            "depotLatitude": 34.45353535,
            "depotLongitude": 32.5535345345,
            "depotDatetime": "202201160800",
            "timezone": 120,
            "endPoints":
            [
                {
                    "geoId": "5432",
                    "latitude": 34.3453455,
                    "longitude": 32.234223423,
                    "address": "Ben Yehuda 100 Tel Aviv",
                    "startTimeWindow": "0800",
                    "endTimeWindow": "1000",
                    "eta": null,
                    
                }
            ]
        }
        
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
             {
                "code": 1000,
                "message": "OK",
                "description": null
            }